# Independent planar detonation validation.
#
# Unburned state:
#   stoichiometric H2/O2, 300 K, 1 atm
# Cantera equilibrium CJ reference for this mechanism:
#   D_CJ     = 2838.5 m/s
#   p_CJ     = 17.984 atm
#   T_CJ     = 3667.3 K
#
# The left state is the equilibrium CJ state.  The right state is the
# unburned mixture.  The transverse direction is periodic and unperturbed,
# so the wave remains quasi-one-dimensional while the full AMR/CUDA path
# is exercised.
